{"id":"wb-6-542","name":"松阳延庆寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"松阳延庆寺塔","text":"松阳延庆寺塔位于中国浙江省丽水市松阳县西屏街道塔寺下村西1公里，为原延庆寺遗物。延庆寺初创于梁普通年间，初名云龙寺，唐改今名；北宋太平兴国四年（979年），行达禅师东归，建塔以藏舍利子，宋咸平二年（999年）动工兴建，五年（1002年）建成，塔高37.20米，塔身为楼阁式砖木结构，六面七层，中空，可登塔顶。2006年5月25日，列入第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%BE%E9%98%B3%E5%BB%B6%E5%BA%86%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86783874,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86783874","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/61ef2bacae6e5b5d55f4b975.jpg","title":"Pagoda_of_Yanqing_Temple,_2022-09-30_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pagoda_of_Yanqing_Temple,_2022-09-30_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f7/Pagoda_of_Yanqing_Temple%2C_2022-09-30_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​松阳延庆寺塔","width":320,"height":214}}